msgid "Every page below shows the console itself, captured from a running instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../marketing/templates/pages/features/nodes.tmpl:58
msgid "Every resource event a run produced is here, with the old and new value for each change and the manifest and line that caused it. It is what the agent sent, not a summary of it."
msgstr ""

#: ../marketing/templates/pages/features/orchestration.tmpl:12
msgid "Every target is recorded on its own: status, exit code and output. A job that worked on nine nodes and failed on one says exactly that, instead of collapsing to a single verdict you then have to go and investigate."
msgstr ""

#: ../marketing/templates/pages/features/access-control.tmpl:34
msgid "Everything else"
msgstr ""

#: ../marketing/templates/pages/features/nodes.tmpl:28
msgid "Filter by name, or by anything your agents report — operating system, kernel, architecture, a custom fact of your own. Answers come from openvoxdb as it stands right now, not from a cache."
